back to school season is upon us but  we've got a list of games that you can  play instead of doing that homework here  are 10 of the biggest games releasing in  september 2022  you know that oof feeling you get when  playing a sequel and then returning to  the first in the series well you won't  have that feeling anymore when going  backwards in the last of us world the  last of us part 1 is the same game we've  all come to know and love but rebuilt  from the ground up for ps5 to help it  reach the bar set by part 2. it features  updated and improved ai a new  perma-death mode a speed run mode an  updated photo mode unlockable costumes  for joel and ellie and a model viewer on  the technical side part 1 can render in  native 4k at a targeted  fps or dynamic 4k at a targeted 60fps  display mode the added power of the ps5  means that the environments have denser  physics with tons of bumpables and  chippables that translate into gunfire  ripping concrete and other objects apart  more accurately with more than 60  accessibility options players can also  expect an audio description mode that  makes the title more approachable and if  ugly crying over the main story isn't  enough for you this also comes with the  left behind dlc you can pet those  giraffes all over again in 4k this time  when the last of us part 1 releases for  ps5 on september 2nd  in nba 2k 23 you control really tall  humans that throw an orange ball at a  bottomless basket attached to some glass  this year's edition of the game marks a  host of changes to the gameplay and  focuses on bringing balance back to the  offensive game new gesture combos such  as double throws and switchbacks are  meant to provide shooting windows in  tight quarters double throw gestures are  used for hop step layups while  switchback gestures are used for euro  step and cradle layups the game's ball  handling controls are also getting  expanded on with the full list of moving  crossovers nearly doubling from last  year's game from 15 to 28 options but  this year's changes aren't just about  offensive play on defense shot blocking  has been tuned to better reflect reality  you can add another game with michael  jordan on the cover to your shelf when  nba 2k23 drops for all consoles and pc  on september 9th  splatoon 3 is a colorful family-friendly  shooter that puts you in the shoes of a  squid kid to fight over turf this third  entry in the series introduces new  splat-fest that will feature not two but  three competing sides first teams will  take part in a standard turf war battle  but then they'll transfer to a special  tri-color turf war with all three teams  battling it out at once all of the  weapons from previous splatoon games  will be returning along with a new bow  and arrow-like weapon called a stinger  and a melee sword weapon with a charge  slash called the splatana the game also  features a new card collecting puzzle  game mode called table turf battle this  mode is described as a 1v1 battle where  you can fill slots on a board with cards  that show geometric shapes like tetris  pieces the co-op mode salmon run is  returning with a number of new  large-scale bosses and the game's new  story mode promises an epic finale to  the splatoon saga take part in the color  war when splatoon 3 comes to nintendo  switch on september 9th  jojo's bizarre adventure all-star battle  r is a 3d fighting game from cyber  connect 2 featuring over 30 characters  and spanning all arcs from the long  running series the game is a remaster of  the 2013 ps3 game by nearly the same  name it's just that this one adds an r  to that the game follows in the lineage  of past anime fighters such as dragon  ball z and naruto giving players a wide  arena in which to do battle while still  focusing on combos counters and waiting  for the right moment to strike in  addition to improved visuals new audio  recordings will also be used in game and  the fighting mechanics have been  adjusted including the addition of hit  stops and jump dashes the fight begins  on pc september 1st and console  september 2nd  steel rising is an action rpg that gives  a look at the french revolution through  an alternate steampunk lens in the game  you play as an automaton guard for marie  antoinette and you'll battle through an  array of mechanized enemies roaming the  streets of an alternate history paris  streets that are filled with secret  passageways and grapple points that make  exploration a joy take advantage of a  wide variety of weapons and skills in  order to define your own playstyle will  you be a deadly dancer a ruthless  warrior or a hard-hitting bodyguard the  choice is all yours but be ready for  steal rising's enemies to test your  patience and skill you can take back  paris from a tyrant king when steel  rising releases for ps5 xbox series xns  and pc on september 8th  metal hellsinger is a fast-paced  rhythm-based first-person shooter in  which you blast your way through demon  hordes to the beat of a badass metal  soundtrack it's everything you loved  about doom 2016 but unlike that game  timing your attacks with the music is  key to your success not only does  staying in sync help build a multiplier  and your score it also activates the  song's lyrics and makes the song more  intense the soundtrack includes songs  made specifically for the game and  features talents of matt heaphy of  trivium and serge tankian of system of a  down just to name a few and although he  won't be singing in the game you can  also expect to hear narration from the  one and only troy baker get ready to do  some karaoke in hell but not really when  metal health singer drops on september  15th for ps5 xbox series xns and pc  return to monkey island sees series  creator ron gilbert back to write and  direct and continues the stories of the  1990s adventure games the secret of  monkey island and monkey island 2  lechuck's revenge that means you should  be prepared to reunite with serious  protagonist guy brush threepwood in a  classic point-and-click-style game with  clever puzzles context-sensitive  interactions reactive dialogue trees and  bizarre swashbuckling situations you can  return to this island of monkeys when  the game drops on september 19th for  switch and pc  powerful creatures have invaded the holy  kingdom of kadus consuming and  corrupting their enemies mankind's only  hope are chimeras hybrid warriors made  of two joined souls in seoul says you  play as briar and luke two sisters that  have undergone the transformation and  have been sent on a mission to reclaim  the city from the wraiths the game  features a diverse combat system that  has you managing briar's superhuman  abilities as well as loot's ghostly  mythical powers simultaneously you can  explore the dark world of solstice this  september 20th on ps5 xbox series xns  and pc  serial cleaners the sequel to 2017  serial cleaner is a top down action  stealth adventure where you play as the  cleanup crew for the mob in 1999 new  york inspired by movies like reservoir  dogs pulp fiction and the usual suspects  you'll play through a non-linear story  covering up crime scenes without getting  caught there are four characters to swap  between each with their own set of  unique skills serial cleaners features  open world map design and you'll need to  use the environment to your advantage  but that shouldn't be too hard  considering you have what the game calls  cleaner sets a boost in awareness to  make better tactical decisions you'll be  mopping up blood and hiding bodies  virtually when serial cleaners comes to  every console and pc on september 22nd  the deal field chronicle is an all-new  tactics ip featuring several warring  nations and a mix of anime style 3d  models and more realistic environments  the game's world mixes fantasy medieval  and modern day influences to tell a  story that square enix has called  compellingly deep the gameplay includes  real-time tactical battles and strategy  based combat that utilizes small squads  you can learn if the blue fox  mercenaries are a symbol of hope or  tragedy when the dealfield chronicle  comes to pc and every console on  september 22nd  so which of these games are you most  interested in and are there any you  can't wait to play that didn't make the  list let me know in the comments you can  follow me on twitter at devante chisholm  and make sure you're subscribed to  gamespot for more  you
 

